{"c":{"160725":["Reiko Kujirai","Female","b160725-amsqiE4A8YKd.png","Reiko Kujirai is a 32-year-old, single woman working at a real estate store in Kowloon Walled City. There she lives alone in an apartment. She has a mole on the left side of her left eye and occasionally wears glasses.",524],"160726":["Hajime Kudou","Male","b160726-OG7wrv0MigAx.png","Hajime is a coworker at the same real estate company as Reiko who frequently arrives late to work. He knows a lot about Kowloon and enjoys the people, culture, and food.",84],"205053":["Miyuki Hebinuma","Non-binary","b205053-Oiuc6c3gQtlQ.jpg","President of Hebinuma Pharmaceutical based in Hong Kong. They are known for always wearing white suits and it's hard to tell what they are thinking. They have an interest in the secrets of Kowloon and Reiko",32],"205054":["Xiaohei",null,"b205054-4ts6uWlnV5wC.png","A girl who lives in Nanto Street, Kowloon. She works part-time in various shops including a shoe shop and cinema, and uses the money she earns to buy more frilly and ribbon covered clothes for her collection. She frequently runs into Reiko and Hajime around the city.",33],"205055":["Youmei","Female","b205055-iVdbDjfr28cd.png","Kujirai Reiko's friend. She recently moved to Kowloon and works sewing stuffed animals. She has a bright personality and a mysterious past.",83],"292981":["Tao Nguyen","Male","b292981-2jmui6aKCtn3.jpg","Kudou's friend and owner of the Goldfish Tea House.",19],"356922":["Yulong","Male","b356922-RJYTgWwKrVm1.png","A mysterious person involved with Miyuki Hebinuma. He is trying to track down people involved in the secrets of Kowloon and discover the truth of the city.",11],"369882":["Li","Male","b369882-hGNeFHrVar6f.png","",0],"369883":["Josei Caster","Female","default.jpg","",0],"369884":["Female Talant","Female","b369884-bEmN7J41bY7l.png","",0],"369885":["Clothing Shop Owner","Male","b369885-QZgaAioNB2HL.png","",0],"369886":["Middle-aged Man B","Male","b369886-l3C7HsvONtk4.png","",0],"369887":["Fem